        println("  memory-augmented map · CA3 pattern-completion). Each fails its controls; the")
        println("  ablation shows the gating/refinement is INERT (compose <= ablate) — the oracle")
        println("  headroom is NOT arbiter-capturable from component reads (joint-trajectory property,")
